<BaseLayout title="Coding Journey — Devina Azaria" description="A curated historical timeline of coding and technology learning from the legacy devina.id archive.">
<section class="shell section page-intro">
  <div class="eyebrow">Journal · Coding Journey</div>
  <h1>From curiosity about coding to structured learning.</h1>
  <p class="lead">The legacy devina.id archive contains a sequence of coding-related material spanning several years. This page preserves that chronology as a learning trail while provenance and authorship are being verified before individual articles are republished.</p>
</section>

<section class="shell section">
  <div class="journey-list">
    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-year">2022</div>
      <div><h2>Early curiosity</h2><p class="muted">Legacy articles such as “Belajar Coding Belajarnya di Mana ya?” and “Manfaat belajar coding sejak dini” show that coding had already become part of the site's learning themes. They are preserved in the migration inventory and are not yet being presented as verified personal authorship.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-year">2024</div>
      <div><h2>Digital tools and web learning</h2><p class="muted">The archive expanded into design tools, web publishing, UI/UX, digital regulation, and other technology-adjacent topics. Most of this material will remain secondary context rather than featured portfolio work.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-year">2025</div>
      <div><h2>Structured coding roadmaps</h2><p class="muted">A series of coding-learning syllabus articles for different age ranges appears in the legacy archive. These are strong candidates for documenting a move from general curiosity toward structured learning, subject to verification of how they were created and used.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="journey-item">
      <div class="journey-year">Now</div>
      <div><h2>Engineering direction</h2><p class="muted">The current portfolio direction connects coding with mechanics, scientific reasoning, engineering projects, and a longer-term interest in aerospace. Future entries should prioritize real builds, experiments, evidence, and reflection.</p></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="shell section">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="tag">Editorial Rule</div>
    <div class="big">History is evidence only when the context is clear.</div>
    <p class="muted">The migration keeps original dates and legacy references, but no article will be labeled as Devina's original work, research, or achievement until its authorship and role are verified.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>